{!Lead.NTE_Event_Code__c} · Expression of interest received

Thank you for your interest in exhibiting.

{!IF(ISBLANK(Lead.FirstName),"Hello,","Hi ")}{!Lead.FirstName}{!IF(ISBLANK(Lead.FirstName),"",",")}

We have received the expression of interest from {!Lead.Company}. The NTE team will review the information and contact you about the most suitable next step.

What happens next

This is an acknowledgement of interest, not confirmation of an exhibition space.

Your expression of interest
